// CoalLedger — Antigravity (AG 2.0) hooks template.
//
// AG shipped a real IDE hooks.json engine (pilot-verified live 2026-07-12), but the
// WIRE LOCATION regressed on an AG update (2026-07-12 -> 07-16): the two previously
// documented locations — global ~/.gemini/config/hooks.json and project
// <workspace>/.agents/hooks.json — stopped executing, and the AG state dir migrated
// from ~/.gemini/antigravity-cli/ to ~/.gemini/antigravity/. RE-DERIVE the current
// hooks.json location + enable switch from AG's current primary docs before wiring.
// Wiring this file at a dead path is inert-harmless: the adapter simply never runs,
// and manual canary invocation (the AG floor tier) is unaffected.
//
// Once the live path is known: copy the object below there and replace
// __COALLEDGER_DIR__ with the directory holding CoalLedger's hooks/ + scripts/lib
// (a global file-copy install puts them at ~/.gemini/config/skills/coalledger,
// keeping the repo-relative layout — the adapter resolves the engine via ../scripts/lib).
// If AG's parser rejects // comments, strip these comment lines — the object below is
// otherwise strict JSON. (This template mirrors the repo's platform-configs/ idiom.)
//
// Event mapping (AG has NO one-shot SessionStart — it never fires in the AG CLI/IDE;
// PreInvocation fires per MODEL CALL, not per user prompt):
//   PreInvocation -> ag-conductor.js : the docs-health canary offers, injected at
//                    most ONCE per session (a per-session tmp marker guards against
//                    re-injecting on every model call; fail-closed on any marker
//                    failure). The self-update nudge is deliberately NOT ported
//                    (its payload is Claude-Code plugin machinery).
// Fail-silent, zero-dep, no network, no child process; the only output is the
// sanctioned {"injectSteps":[{"ephemeralMessage":...}]} JSON (the current AG contract;
// input payload is camelCase protojson: conversationId, workspacePaths[], transcriptPath).
{
  "coalledger": {
    "PreInvocation": [
      { "type": "command", "command": "node \"__COALLEDGER_DIR__/hooks/ag-conductor.js\" PreInvocation", "timeout": 30 }
    ]
  }
}
